L["Saurfang is gone. Nathanos Blightcaller has been dispatched to find him — and bring him back before he becomes a problem."] = "Colmillosauro ha desaparecido. Han enviado a Nathanos Clamañublo a buscarlo y traerlo de vuelta antes de que se convierta en un problema."
